<title>USA: Fidelity Bankshares to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Fidelity Bankshares to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Bankshares Inc said Tuesday that its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to 337,000, or five percent, of the company's total outstanding common stock.</p>
</text>
